.TH "CSSSTYLEVALUE.PARSEALL_STATIC" "3JS" "August 4, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
CSSStyleValue.parseAll_static \- CSSStyleValue: parseAll() static method
.SH SYNOPSIS
The \f[B]\f[CB]parseAll()\f[B]\f[R] static method of the
\f[CR]CSSStyleValue\f[R] interface sets all occurrences of a specific
CSS property to the specified value and returns an array of
\f[CR]CSSStyleValue\f[R] objects, each containing one of the supplied
values.
.RS
.PP
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This method cannot be called in \f[CR]Worker\f[R] or
\f[CR]Worklet\f[R] contexts.
The rest of the \f[CR]CSSStyleValue\f[R] interface remains available in
workers and worklets.
.RE
.SH SYNTAX
.IP
.EX
CSSStyleValue.parseAll(property, value)
.EE
.SS Parameters
.TP
\f[B]property\f[R]
A CSS property to set.
.TP
\f[B]value\f[R]
A comma\-separated string containing one or more values that apply to
the provided property.
.SS Return value
An array of \f[CR]CSSStyleValue\f[R] objects, each containing one of the
supplied values.
.SH SEE ALSO
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]CSSStyleValue.parse()\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
Using the CSS Typed OM
.IP \(bu 2
CSS Typed Object Model API
